83
00:06:34,913 --> 00:06:39,892
Narrator: Call summary: A caller claiming to be from Mumbai police said an FIR was registered and

84
00:06:39,892 --> 00:06:42,468
Narrator: demanded a video call under threat of arrest.

85
00:06:42,468 --> 00:06:46,989
Narrator: This matches the known 'digital arrest' scam, and the AI disconnected the call.

86
00:06:50,089 --> 00:06:53,280
Narrator: Vexa shares nothing and ends the call in one turn.

87
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:57,556
